            <div xml:id="m-63258ee1-5dc3-4826-835c-c29c3574245e">
              <lg xml:id="m-0d25245a-6171-49b9-a5a1-39643cdf53fe">
                <l xml:id="m-9c04d0e3-f1c0-4d3b-94ca-5c8c9ae32a54" facs="#m-4e247773-cfd7-48e5-9fc0-226f534613ef" label="ambiguous">261</l><l xml:id="m-02c11680-9497-44fe-af4d-de5d39bb366a" facs="#m-952abc10-c6e4-4719-abb8-44acf0a5d666" label="text-like">sunday at Vespers.</l><l xml:id="m-ee8e14d2-2639-4d93-9cad-7d7df0c014a5" facs="#m-028f9d32-fc22-4e4b-80f9-2b48d65f27ae" label="lyrics-like">pacem; ** ut destrúctis adversitá- Jesum Christum Filium tuum:</l><l xml:id="m-20d35950-4b6d-4c4c-b8f8-20dade4de30c" facs="#m-45ba12a4-f9c3-4370-b531-e8d92724e737" label="lyrics-like">tibus et erróribus univérsis. * Ecclé- qui tecum vivit et regnat in uni¬</l><l xml:id="m-15a9c95e-b58e-49ad-a52f-1607f250a1b8" facs="#m-4903dfe9-22e0-4b17-acb0-a24b4fc7e2d0" label="lyrics-like">sia tua secúra tibi sérviat libertáte. táte Spiritus Sancti Deus, per ómnia</l><l xml:id="m-ef5ffab9-ee97-42ee-8f05-07521e891c84" facs="#m-88428bf6-e850-450a-bb1f-b1d8c0fc78eb" label="lyrics-like">Per eúmdem Dóminum nostrum saécula saeculórum. B. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-6660aa0e-52b4-48f3-bee6-ff52433f85b1" facs="#m-fe1a1afa-cfed-483e-a89a-43fcbb2b8d10" label="text-like">TIn this Prayer, the Titular Saint of the Church, in which the Office is</l><l xml:id="m-3c9e4afb-ffce-430d-a713-b9c5d626e35b" facs="#m-9be8f1e8-cdf0-4610-aa03-69eae2b4f39c" label="text-like">celebrated, is named at the letter N. An Archangel and St. John the Baptist</l><l xml:id="m-9e2dfb0f-cfe5-447d-99e1-d653be6df860" facs="#m-8ff4ad65-9dcc-4d93-84cd-a9218af163a2" label="ambiguous">are named before St. Joseph.</l><l xml:id="m-b38c8f79-a16f-462b-b3c7-ad19a14273c8" facs="#m-eaecc29a-ad39-4c6a-9073-1b9846c62799" label="text-like">In Paschal Time, this Suffrage is replaced by the Conmemoration of the</l><l xml:id="m-0d65e19f-dba2-4ec0-93ac-0850a37bf3f0" facs="#m-b81bbf78-84e2-4611-aaa5-3ceda7a86eb2" label="text-like">Cross which is said according to the same rubrics.</l><l xml:id="m-8187236e-5f83-43a4-aa48-905091ac8466" facs="#m-6d50c5b4-f356-4633-877b-b02c5fe3b9b4" label="text-like">Commemoration of the Cross.</l><l xml:id="m-7289ef7b-c842-445d-b7d4-61a6eece41e4" facs="#m-de5cea12-25ea-41a9-9f7b-743ef2b704af" label="ambiguous">Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-9d056d1f-6190-4b36-9395-0e4a93d5203a" facs="#m-8b9718a6-bf10-4651-baf0-acee3a128dca" label="ambiguous">6.</l><l xml:id="m-c9a17fc9-8d28-4c97-b786-33767b9aaad9" facs="#m-b0896e85-8675-43e5-a03b-597ca65ef1a8" label="lyrics-like">Ruci- fixus* surréxit a mórtu¬</l><l xml:id="m-6b757a61-c78b-4a87-ac4d-e5023949d388" facs="#m-ac06db86-7c07-4eea-9b4a-2749f83e3f84" label="lyrics-like">et red- émit</l><l xml:id="m-f6d41626-5697-402d-b025-d5a83d98fc2d" facs="#m-5cb9717b-a382-4426-ad1c-d9093d7542d7" label="text-like">is,</l><l xml:id="m-a3e5e627-626a-4aa1-a16c-72c658a2d7f4" facs="#m-45c65f93-1151-4972-89c0-058820bfeb21" label="lyrics-like">nos, alle- lú¬ ia, alle-lú-ia.</l><l xml:id="m-ab3f6e28-5ed8-415f-811e-fcf72b605d78" facs="#m-70e94d1a-3039-49f4-ae7d-ffee2224cd31" label="lyrics-like">V. Dícite in natiónibus, allelúia.</l><l xml:id="m-a3ce1bfd-b478-4dd0-bfd9-51bf5f7e5d6a" facs="#m-ba3b1887-9efc-47df-9cfc-89206d2e7100" label="lyrics-like">R. Quia Dóminus regnávit a ligno, allelúia.</l><l xml:id="m-ccb6641b-3768-4a8e-961e-9dc5496ffee5" facs="#m-62a40eda-16c8-4dec-b0b2-44bb96b1d93a" label="lyrics-like">Orémus.</l><l xml:id="m-96e77730-b0f7-49c7-97a8-54414bf0d463" facs="#m-437ab727-2fba-4b11-8f02-7f396ba4fe90" label="text-like">Prayer.</l><l xml:id="m-5fda30cc-7c25-45fb-b675-f1c91b92e4fb" facs="#m-56c74fc1-5845-4481-8f33-621ab5629b99" label="lyrics-like">Eus, qui pro nobis Filium tuum ! Dóminum nostrum Jesum Christum</l><l xml:id="m-26edfca4-5d4a-4923-bc82-73806c014b0a" facs="#m-4368366e-ff1a-43b1-8b97-b729f3aabe0c" label="ambiguous">Filium tuum:* qui tecum vivit et</l><l xml:id="m-dc09a34a-e09b-4f7e-94f4-cc388f3ffacc" facs="#m-c33f7ad4-5c22-4510-ae79-bf4882086b1f" label="ambiguous">OCrucis patsbulum subire vo¬</l><l xml:id="m-1c539a4b-6ae6-4894-a35b-ff8c52f48be4" facs="#m-1da53c94-1fde-437e-ac7e-4eba063cfee7" label="lyrics-like">regnat in unitáte Spiritus Sancti</l><l xml:id="m-415be280-626e-46af-a577-aed3d9298191" facs="#m-71b079b2-91f6-491b-ad3d-66967d3efa66" label="lyrics-like">luísti, ut inimíci a nobis expélle¬</l><l xml:id="m-28c04be8-e566-4808-8b76-59870939c76d" facs="#m-bbb25b44-99fb-49c2-8c9f-fb266a73d6ba" label="lyrics-like">Deus, per ómnia saécula saeculó¬</l><l xml:id="m-921dd4db-d623-458e-baa6-6ac024a5991d" facs="#m-4160d5fe-6a83-496c-afa7-120fbacd7bc8" label="lyrics-like">res potestátem: *concéde nobis</l><l xml:id="m-a420b0c2-da9b-4a39-8862-7870fa97fc77" facs="#m-9229e001-b44b-4c97-b5c3-ad94f5712b58" label="lyrics-like">fámulis tuis; ut resurrectiónis grá-[rum. R. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-926dac6d-6da3-4ce2-bbad-80f81aa7002b" facs="#m-34501730-15b0-411d-8165-f05906750bcb" label="lyrics-like">tiam consequámur. Per eúmdem</l><l xml:id="m-a1e38920-4b8a-48b1-8d2f-0769538f21ae" facs="#m-0b30219a-929a-404d-9fb7-59951f6f7b6b" label="lyrics-like">V. Dóminus vobíscum. R. Et cum spíritu túo.</l><l xml:id="m-99dab309-3e09-4fc1-9cd4-052288df24e5" facs="#m-cdb89275-9de6-410c-9dff-48af0f85735c" label="text-like">The Cantors.</l><l xml:id="m-eb2086d1-7777-4318-9565-f9bc52cfff62" facs="#m-11d55089-e59f-462a-95b4-3157c4834ecf" label="lyrics-like">V. Benedicámus Dómino. R. Déo grátias. 124.</l><l xml:id="m-37b63251-5085-45bf-a94c-e6d338d14ad5" facs="#m-427b2e8e-4da2-406c-b90c-387387c977e5" label="text-like">The Officiant next says recto tono in a low voice.</l><l xml:id="m-1450d243-3c1f-4d27-8623-810a04d42534" facs="#m-173f4cb0-917f-4a32-a82b-9ca79012e5fc" label="lyrics-like">V. Fidélium ánimae per misericórdiam Déi requiéscant in páce.</l><l xml:id="m-f6f114e1-dee9-4bb6-aec3-d9b7edec929d" facs="#m-b6cd4076-1be7-4fc2-828f-292d802146f4" label="ambiguous">K. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-2a0c74f4-6421-4dea-9cbb-76850e8649f9" facs="#m-2906e746-12f6-4d61-a549-338eb7d644c1" label="text-like">Compline is then said. However, if Compline is not to follow immediatelr,</l><l xml:id="m-e7e01326-0b13-4d0e-be21-83cee3397137" facs="#m-af6253aa-be46-4b68-ab69-f6a41a87907c" label="text-like">the Pater noster. is here said in silence, and the Officiant adds the follouins</l><l xml:id="m-bfa262dd-c75a-4322-b45c-b5da367a50d5" facs="#m-a38f18e3-e3c2-4cf3-82d6-5e7d5f5e864c" label="lyrics-like">V., in the same tone as the V. Fidélium.</l><l xml:id="m-f98c4657-ee9e-42d4-9eb3-c9708a315638" facs="#m-414e1c13-6d71-49d9-bf42-656ff1747970" label="lyrics-like">v. Dóminus det nóbis súam pácem.</l><l xml:id="m-af35053d-0982-4946-a83b-eb89690c935d" facs="#m-25e72711-7905-4bef-80e9-10c5ef7ef5ce" label="lyrics-like">K. Et vitam aetérnam. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-98cc5c87-6508-496f-9991-8beb1e1f545f" facs="#m-76eba309-c656-4473-99c7-c919acb8a5c9" label="text-like">An Anthem to the Blessed Virgin is then sung according to the Season.</l><l xml:id="m-dfc6939b-97b1-4f5f-b31a-ecc4d1a317c4" facs="#m-22ff4ddb-209d-4a50-a6c9-f1bfe9b1cae7" label="text-like">p.277. After which, the follouing is said recto tono in a lon voice</l><l xml:id="m-b04372d8-359e-43c8-8ebc-2db4752900c1" facs="#m-8dfd6b99-828d-46e1-9963-592307a1e067" label="ambiguous">as above:</l><l xml:id="m-480289a3-0a07-43ff-ba91-a29ccc38b498" facs="#m-1780e390-6a22-4d0a-b8eb-c72839da96f8" label="lyrics-like">V. Divínum auxílium máneat semper nobíscum.</l><l xml:id="m-dd94abb0-38bf-4778-a874-63369b6a316a" facs="#m-2f2632e6-041a-4a54-869f-a5e7ef2bab9a" label="ambiguous">R. Amen.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>